From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mpc823 <11076149+mpc823@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 11:20:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] helpers: keep ramfs magic compatible with 32-bit switch

The historical ramfs magic value does not fit in a signed int literal on
modern compilers. Preserve the value while matching the type of statfs.f_type.

Upstream-Status: Pending
Signed-off-by: mpc823 <11076149+mpc823@users.noreply.github.com>
---
 src/system/helpers.cpp | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/src/system/helpers.cpp b/src/system/helpers.cpp
index 1111111..2222222 100644
--- a/src/system/helpers.cpp
+++ b/src/system/helpers.cpp
@@ -302,1 +302,1 @@
-			case 0x858458f6L: 	// ramfs
+			case (int)0x858458f6U: 	// ramfs
